WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.860
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.350
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>We are!</i>

00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:57.480
How the Black Cat Pirates
have fallen...

00:01:57.480 --> 00:02:00.050
Right?!

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:02.980
U-us, feeble?!

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:06.780
Zoro!

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:11.260
Thanks!

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:13.660
Tiger Trap!

00:02:14.660 --> 00:02:16.490
Get up!

00:02:18.270 --> 00:02:20.260
Nami, you jerk!

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:25.810
Klahadore!

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:26.970
Stop this!

00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:28.880
Run away, Kaya!

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:32.410
I devoted myself to you...

00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:35.780
For so long!

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:42.120
Yes, it was all so that
I could kill you today...

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:46.290
Damn you!

00:02:55.570 --> 00:03:00.130
<i>If you hate getting hit that much,
I got a hundred more punches for you!</i>

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:07.250
<i>"Beat Kuro! Usopp the Man's
Tearful Resolve!"</i>

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:22.900
--What was that?!
--What did he do?!

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:24.100
It looked like his arm stretched!

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:28.660
--Get real!
--He sent Captain Kuro flying!

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:48.350
I leave the rest to you!

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:51.680
I'm gonna get me some treasure!

00:03:56.030 --> 00:04:01.870
--The Usopp Pirates have arrived!
--The Usopp Pirates have arrived!

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:03.970
--You guys!
--Stay away!

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:06.670
Say your prayers, butt-ler!

00:04:06.670 --> 00:04:08.410
It's punishment time!

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:10.310
Lousy pirate!
Disrupting this village's peace!

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:11.980
S-stop!

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:13.210
--Darn you!
--Take this!

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:17.420
You brats! What are you doing?!

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:19.390
What're those runts doing?!

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:23.650
Stop that, you guys... Stop!

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:29.660
Alright! We'll let you
off with just that!

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:37.910
<i>Now Captain Kuro is really mad!</i>

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:41.210
Those stupid brats!

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:42.410
Captain!

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:44.950
<i>I knew it! You were fighting, Captain!</i>

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:48.320
Why didn't you tell us?!
That's unbare!

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:50.620
No! You mean "unfair!"

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:57.190
Who cares about that! You guys
just gotta get out of here! Run!

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:58.130
No!

00:04:58.130 --> 00:05:00.230
We're gonna fight, too!

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:03.360
The Usopp Pirates will
be shamed if we run!

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:20.210
You idiots! Get out of here, now!

00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:36.090
Captain!

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:45.510
That hurt a bit...

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:49.540
That's quite a strange
technique you have there...

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:54.850
I take it you have
Devil Fruit powers?!

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:58.990
Yep! I ate the Gum-Gum Fruit!

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:00.450
I'm a rubber person!

00:06:00.450 --> 00:06:03.220
--What?! A Devil Fruit?!
--He's dangerous!

00:06:03.220 --> 00:06:06.190
--They really do exist?!
--I thought he seemed strange!

00:06:06.190 --> 00:06:12.660
<i>I see. A rubber person. So I didn't
hallucinate his arm-stretching...</i>

00:06:13.900 --> 00:06:15.440
--Jango!
--Yeah?

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:21.980
I'll handle the boy.
You take care of Miss Kaya.

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:25.180
As we planned, have her write a will...

00:06:25.180 --> 00:06:27.650
...then kill her!

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:32.920
And those three little ants...
They're an eyesore!

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:36.580
I'm on it.

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:45.600
Stop. I can't let you pass.

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:47.590
Butchie!

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:52.270
Cat...

00:06:52.270 --> 00:06:54.440
...Astrophe!

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:55.770
Not again!

00:07:29.280 --> 00:07:33.650
He's on a completely different
level than before!

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:35.520
Crap!

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:37.990
Kaya!

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:50.230
<i>Dammit...</i>

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:52.530
<i>I'm out of strength...</i>

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:56.970
<i>Dammit... Dammit! Dammit...</i>

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:58.870
<i>D-damn...</i>

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:03.370
Usopp Pirates!

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:06.780
--Y-yes, sir?!
--Y-yes, sir?!

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:08.950
Listen to me!

00:08:08.950 --> 00:08:10.480
We're not going to run!

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:12.150
Not after they did this to you!

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:15.160
We're going to avenge you!

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:17.220
Protect Kaya!

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:22.500
Listen closely!

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:23.860
I'm giving...

00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:29.540
I'm giving you the most important
task there is now!

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:32.510
Take Kaya and get away from here!

00:08:32.510 --> 00:08:34.410
Don't tell me you can't!

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:38.380
That was the reason we
formed our pirate group:

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:42.980
to become men who protect
what's important to us!

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:46.840
<i>Usopp-san...</i>

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:55.000
That's... a direct order...

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:57.660
--Yes, Captain!
--Yes, Captain!

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:59.700
<i>--Hurry, Kaya-san!
--This way! This way!</i>

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:00.930
This way!

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:03.240
<i>He sure knows how to talk all big.</i>

00:09:03.240 --> 00:09:05.110
<i>He basically just told 'em to run away...</i>

00:09:05.110 --> 00:09:07.710
The woods are like our backyard!

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:09.040
O-okay...

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:13.150
Jango!

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:15.150
I wound up gawking!

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:19.180
The fools!
They can't possibly escape me-

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:24.890
Howdya like that?!

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:26.790
Damn you!

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:29.760
Go after them, you fool!

00:09:29.760 --> 00:09:33.000
Y-yeah, okay!

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:37.910
How pointless.

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:41.480
I know very well just
how weak Kaya is...

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:45.410
She'll never escape Jango.
If you want to help her,

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:49.180
go right ahead.

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:53.920
If you can get past this
hill alive, that is.

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:00.090
Butchie!

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:11.410
You already lost to me once!
I told you not to get in my way!

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:13.530
Move!

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:24.780
W-what's that sound?!

00:11:24.780 --> 00:11:28.120
Who knows. Ol' Jango is probably
tearing the place up.

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:31.020
Why not go and see for yourself?

00:11:31.020 --> 00:11:35.510
Though it may already be too late...

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:39.360
Damn you...

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:44.800
Don't you even have a shred of pity?!
You lived with her for 3 years!

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:45.670
No.

00:11:45.670 --> 00:11:50.240
I already told you, Kaya is nothing
more than a pawn in my plan.

00:11:50.240 --> 00:11:54.440
<i>Once she's dead, then I'll
express some gratitude.</i>

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:57.640
Damn you...

00:11:57.640 --> 00:11:59.680
What a helplessly evil guy!

00:11:59.680 --> 00:12:03.180
I don't plan to help him, though!

00:12:03.180 --> 00:12:06.420
Usopp!

00:12:06.420 --> 00:12:09.890
Go to them!

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:13.260
We'll take over here!

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:15.250
Leave it to us!

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:54.870
Oh? You can still move?
How impressive.

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:56.370
Shut up...

00:12:56.370 --> 00:13:01.640
I refuse to let you... have your way!

00:13:01.640 --> 00:13:08.050
You went and betrayed the villagers' -
and Kaya's - feelings...

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:14.190
I refuse to let you have
your way anymore!

00:13:14.190 --> 00:13:15.990
Usopp!

00:13:20.230 --> 00:13:22.260
D-dammit...

00:13:22.260 --> 00:13:25.960
I... can't... move...

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:35.280
You really are a riot!

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:37.440
I betrayed them, you say?!

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:42.020
Cut the crap! This was
all part of the plan!

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:48.090
A kiddie pirate captain like you
has no place to talk all-knowingly!

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:52.560
Just stay on the ground there.

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:55.800
Though, even if you did
catch up with Jango,

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:58.700
you'd be no match for him anyway.

00:13:58.700 --> 00:14:02.300
This way is probably safest for you!

00:14:02.300 --> 00:14:05.440
<i>Even if I am no match...</i>

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:11.980
<i>Even if I am no match for him...
I will protect them!</i>

00:14:11.980 --> 00:14:15.420
I'm captain of the Usopp Pirates...

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:19.020
...and a brave warrior of the sea!

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:26.020
I won't let you lay
a finger on the village!

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:32.570
--What's with him?
--He's yellin' somethin'!

00:14:32.570 --> 00:14:34.690
Check it out, he's cryin'!

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:49.470
What's so funny?!

00:14:52.090 --> 00:14:53.650
Luffy!

00:14:53.650 --> 00:14:57.190
Me and Usopp are gonna chase
that hypno-freak! That a problem?!

00:14:57.190 --> 00:14:59.130
Nope! Hurry!

00:14:59.130 --> 00:15:01.260
T-thanks...

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:05.470
I'd actually be much faster by myself,
but they're inside some woods.

00:15:05.470 --> 00:15:08.640
I'm gonna need your directions
to catch up to him.

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:14.210
Hold it, you two. Who gave you
permission to pass this hill?

00:15:14.210 --> 00:15:15.730
<i>I did!</i>

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:18.970
Go! Zoro! Usopp!

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:22.210
And another!

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:32.530
Gum-Gum Spear!

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:34.830
Darn! He disappeared again!

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:39.830
Oh, well! They're past
the hill, at least!

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:43.770
Before fighting, I have
one thing to ask you.

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:49.180
Why is an outsider like you butting
into this village's business?!

00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:53.410
Because there's a man in this
village I don't wanna let die!

00:15:53.410 --> 00:15:58.290
<i>How simple. Are you okay with
that being why you die?!</i>

00:15:58.290 --> 00:16:01.790
Yep! I'm not gonna die, though!

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:04.120
I'll make sure you do!

00:16:10.760 --> 00:16:14.500
Gum-Gum Whip!

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:16.490
...and Pistol!

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:23.980
You're making me yawn!

00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:25.640
Why, you...

00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:35.620
Damn... He cut my mouth...

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:39.390
That straw hat guy's
insanely strong, and yet...

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:43.000
T-that's Captain Kuro for ya!

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:45.870
--Get 'im!
--Hurray for Captain Kuro!

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:49.040
--Captain Kuro!
--You're awesome, Captain Kuro!

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:53.870
Don't call me that name!

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:56.940
Do you still not get it?!

00:16:56.940 --> 00:17:04.580
This plan is so I can be completely
rid of the name "Captain Kuro!"

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:07.550
I'm tired...

00:17:07.550 --> 00:17:13.360
Devising plans everyday for you men
who only care about mayhem...

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:17.960
Being relentlessly attacked by
government dogs and bounty hunters...

00:17:17.960 --> 00:17:22.270
I was absolutely sick of it all!

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:28.980
The navy, huh...

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:33.510
This is the third time this week...

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:38.950
It can't be helped. We're doing
stuff that makes people chase us.

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:41.620
Plus you've made quite
a name for yourself...

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:46.530
Yes... That name is what
draws them to us.

00:17:46.530 --> 00:17:52.930
That's why I'm giving
up being Captain Kuro.

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:57.300
That's pretty funny. But it's no use.

00:17:57.300 --> 00:18:01.240
I think the navy'll keep
following you until you're dead.

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:08.780
<i>I am going to die.</i>

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:13.150
It would seem that piracy
just isn't for me...

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:16.260
B-but you're this ship's captain!

00:18:16.260 --> 00:18:19.160
<i>You can be captain!</i>

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:23.290
I'm sick of this tumultuous lifestyle.

00:18:25.730 --> 00:18:30.600
I'm... going to kill
myself for all to see!

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:31.610
Captain Kuro!

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:33.510
--Captain!
--Captain!

00:18:33.510 --> 00:18:35.240
How many vessels?

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:36.840
J-just one!

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:40.710
What should we do, Captain?!
Should we blast 'em back?!

00:18:40.710 --> 00:18:42.950
Lower a small boat.

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:45.940
--Huh?!
--A boat!

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:52.990
Vice-Captain Jango!
Captain Kuro just-

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:54.330
Yeah, I know.

00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:57.830
"Yeah?!" It's way too reckless
for him to go there by himself!

00:18:57.830 --> 00:19:00.670
Don't tell me he's
turning himself in?!

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:17.780
--H-huh?!
--The cannon fire stopped...

00:19:17.780 --> 00:19:21.120
--What's goin' on?!
--This is creepy...

00:19:23.920 --> 00:19:25.490
Dock with their ship.

00:19:25.490 --> 00:19:27.460
B-but...

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:30.030
Just do as I say, damn it!

00:19:30.030 --> 00:19:31.970
--Y-yes, sir!
--Hey, get ready to fight!

00:19:31.970 --> 00:19:36.940
<i>I see... So that's why...</i>

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:38.740
Hey, you.

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:41.240
Y-yes?! What is it?

00:19:41.240 --> 00:19:44.300
It was nice knowing you
for this short time...

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:07.460
--T-the marines...
--They've been wiped out!

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:17.200
Now, then...

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:23.110
Let's begin the plan...

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:30.160
Hey, now. Pull yourself together.

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:33.830
I was kind enough to leave
you alive, you know...

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:36.360
S-shut up...

00:20:36.360 --> 00:20:40.130
I- I'm not gonna beg for my life...

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:43.800
F-finish me off, damn you...

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:47.870
That's a good look.

00:20:47.870 --> 00:20:52.540
If you can howl that much with
a shattered jaw, then that's perfect!

00:20:54.650 --> 00:21:00.720
I'm giving you, a nameless,
low-ranking soldier, a treat.

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:04.160
Accept it gratefully...

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:08.290
...The head of Kuro,
Man of a Thousand Plans!

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:13.570
Your name is Captain Kuro.
Your name is Captain Kuro.

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:16.600
This atrocity was your doing.

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:20.310
One, two, Jango!

00:21:20.310 --> 00:21:25.750
My name is Captain Kuro.
This atrocity was my doing.

00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:30.080
<i>And you're the man who
caught Captain Kuro.</i>

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:33.120
Return to base and execute this man.

00:21:33.120 --> 00:21:37.290
One, two, Jango!

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:40.960
I'm the man who caught Captain Kuro!

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:43.630
You're doing it again, Vice-Captain!

00:21:43.630 --> 00:21:45.270
<i>Perfect...</i>

00:21:45.270 --> 00:21:52.260
<i>With that fake gone, Captain Kuro
will disappear from the world.</i>

00:21:54.310 --> 00:22:02.250
And when my plan today succeeds,
my goal will be fully achieved...

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:05.420
Money and peace of mind will be mine.

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:07.590
Do you understand, boy?

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:12.860
I cannot allow this plan
of three years to fail!

00:22:12.860 --> 00:22:16.890
<i>My plan will not be disrupted!</i>

00:22:22.870 --> 00:22:25.870
Seems you can do more than just stretch!

00:22:25.870 --> 00:22:31.040
That's right! I've toughened
myself up, to be a pirate!

00:22:33.350 --> 00:22:34.850
You're "tired?!"

00:22:34.850 --> 00:22:39.180
You're not fit to be a pirate if having
a name on the seas scares you!

00:22:46.090 --> 00:22:51.030
My ambition is much greater than yours!

00:22:56.140 --> 00:23:06.130
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:37.070
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.540 --> 00:23:45.550
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.550 --> 00:23:52.630
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.630 --> 00:24:02.620
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
